date-released: '2026-XX-XX'        # fill at tagging
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/<USER>/degp-artifact'
abstract: >-
  Artifact for "Decoupled Entropic-Geometric Planning (DEGP):
  Verified Conditioning, Measured Mechanisms, and a Mapped
  Contact-Prediction Boundary in Latent-World-Model Deployment".
  Contains the degp package, the 12-check verification suite, the
  checkpointed 6-cell experimental battery (Push-T deployment and
  18-condition attribution battery), per-seed results for every
  table, all figures, and the pre-registration register.
keywords:
  - world models
  - model-based planning
  - representation learning
  - pre-registration
  - Push-T
  - reproducibility
